+ ShowcaseElevation is (title String, blur Length, y Coord, spread Length)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ showcase-elevations [ShowcaseElevation]

* ShowcaseElevation("Resting", 4, 1, 0)
* ShowcaseElevation("Raised", 14, 5, 0)
* ShowcaseElevation("Floating", 30, 12, -2)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ ShowcaseTagShape is BoxShape

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is BoxShape ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ do path
    - node Box
    - rect Rect
    - canvas Canvas

. point = rect.height / 2
. corner = 5
canvas.move(rect.x + corner, rect.y)
canvas.line(rect.right - point, rect.y)
canvas.line(rect.right, rect.y + point)
canvas.line(rect.right - point, rect.bottom)
canvas.line(rect.x + corner, rect.bottom)
canvas.curve(rect.x, rect.bottom, rect.x, rect.bottom, rect.x, rect.bottom - corner)
canvas.line(rect.x, rect.y + corner)
canvas.curve(rect.x, rect.y, rect.x, rect.y, rect.x + corner, rect.y)
canvas.enclose()
